RULE-SET,https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JIAQI23333/proxy-routing-rules/main/rules/instagram.list,Instagram-香港手动
RULE-SET,https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JIAQI23333/proxy-routing-rules/main/rules/x.list,X-香港手动
RULE-SET,https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JIAQI23333/proxy-routing-rules/main/rules/tiktok.list,TikTok-台湾手动
RULE-SET,https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JIAQI23333/proxy-routing-rules/main/rules/facebook.list,Facebook-香港手动
